  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": "/* Draw the configuration: two triangles perspective from O,\n   and the axis on which the three side-intersections land. */\npoly(pts)  := block([q], q : append(pts, [pts[1]]),\n                    [discrete, map(first, float(q)), map(second, float(q))])$\nseg(p, q)  := [discrete, [float(p[1]), float(q[1])], [float(p[2]), float(q[2])]]$\n\nPa : chart(Pp)$  Qa : chart(Qp)$  Ra : chart(Rp)$\n\nplot2d([ poly([Aa, Ba, Ca]),           /* triangle ABC      */\n         poly([Aa2, Ba2, Ca2]),        /* triangle A'B'C'   */\n         seg(Oa, Aa2), seg(Oa, Ba2), seg(Oa, Ca2),   /* the three rays from O */\n         seg(Pa, Ra),                  /* the axis of perspective */\n         [discrete, [0], [0]],\n         [discrete, map(first, float([Pa, Qa, Ra])),\n                    map(second, float([Pa, Qa, Ra]))] ],\n       [x, -9, 11], [y, -12, 10],\n       [style, [lines,2], [lines,2], [lines,1], [lines,1], [lines,1],\n               [lines,3], [points,3], [points,3]],\n       [legend, false], [same_xy, true],\n       [title, \"Desargues: perspective from O ⟹ P, Q, R collinear\"])$",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": 7,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
